<title>USA: U.S. meat production up 7.1 pct from week ago-USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. meat production up 7.1 pct from week ago-USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Red meat production for week ending Saturday, Jan 4, rose 7.1 pct at 678.9 million lbs.-USDA</p>
<p>WEEK ENDING/1  BEEF   CALF/VEAL   PORK/2 LAMB/MUTTON TOTALS/3</p>
<p>04-Jan-97	389.7    5.4	 280.0	3.8	678.9</p>
<p>28-Dec-96	359.9    5.3	 265.0	3.6	633.8</p>
<p>Change:	   8.3%    1.9%	 5.7%	5.6%	 7.1%</p>
<p>06-Jan-96	433.0    5.8	 303.0	4.4	746.2</p>
<p>Change:	 -10.0%   -6.9%	-7.6%    -13.6%	-9.0%</p>
<p>1997 YTD:	228.8    2.7	 150.9	1.8	384.2</p>
<p>1996 YTD:	433.0    5.8	 303.0	4.4	746.2</p>
<p>Change:	 -47.2%  -53.5%     -50.2%    -59.1%     -48.5%</p>
<p>LIVESTOCK SLAUGHTER (HEAD)</p>
<p>WEEK ENDING   CATTLE   CALVES/VEALERS     HOGS     SHEEP/LAMBS</p>
<p>04-Jan-97     574,000	26,000     1,483,000	58,000</p>
<p>28-Dec-96     528,000	26,000     1,404,000	55,000</p>
<p>Change:	   8.7%	  0.0%	    5.6%	  5.5%</p>
<p>06-Jan-96     604,000	28,000     1,618,000	70,000</p>
<p>Change:	  -5.0%	 -7.1%	   -8.3%	-17.1%</p>
<p>1997 YTD:     337,000	13,000	 799,000	28,000</p>
<p>1996 YTD:*    604,000	28,000     1,618,000	70,000</p>
<p>Change:	 -44.2%	 -53.7%	  -50.6%	-60.0%</p>
<p>*1996 slaughter totals adjusted to reflect NASS revisions.  </p>
<p>AVERAGE WEIGHTS (LBS.)</p>
<p>WEEK ENDING  LIVE CATTLE   CALVES/VEALERS     HOGS   SHEEP/LAMBS</p>
<p>04-Jan-97    Est  1163	     355	   260	  132</p>
<p>28-Dec-96    Est  1166	     356	   259	  131</p>
<p>06-Jan-96 Actual  1209	     358	   257	  127</p>
<p>Dressed</p>
<p>04-Jan-97    Est   682	     209	   189	   65</p>
<p>28-Dec-96    Est   685	     209	   189	   65</p>
<p>06-Jan-96 Actual   720	     212	   188	   64</p>
<p>FOR THE WEEK PERCENTAGE OF TOTAL CATTLE SLAUGHTERED BY CLASS</p>
<p>ENDING	 STEERS	HEIFERS     COWS     BULLS &amp; STAGS</p>
<p>21-Dec-96     44.6%	 31.2%	22.5%     1.8%</p>
<p>23-Dec-95     51.3%	 27.3%	19.7%     1.7%</p>
<p>FOR THE WEEK PERCENTAGE OF TOTAL HOGS SLAUGHTERED BY CLASS</p>
<p>ENDING	BARROWS &amp; GILTS	    SOWS     STAGS &amp; BOARS</p>
<p>21-Dec-96     96.0%			3.4%	0.6%</p>
<p>23-Dec-95     95.3%			3.9%	0.9%</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 YTD reflects six production days.</p>
<p>1997 YTD reflects four production days</p>
<p>(Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720)</p>
